<view class="page"><view class="card profile"><button class="avatar-btn" open-type="chooseAvatar" bindchooseavatar="chooseAvatar"><image wx:if="{{avatarUrl}}" src="{{avatarUrl}}" class="avatar"/><view wx:else class="avatar placeholder">＋</view></button><input type="nickname" class="nickname" placeholder="点击填写昵称" value="{{nickname}}" bindchange="nickname"/><button class="mini-save" bindtap="save">保存资料</button></view><view class="card"><view class="row line"><text>我的消费记录</text><text class="primary">{{count}} 笔</text></view><view class="row line"><text>数据存储</text><text class="muted">微信云开发</text></view><view class="row line last"><text>账号隔离</text><text class="muted">按微信身份自动隔离</text></view></view><view class="notice"><view class="notice-title">隐私说明</view><view>消费数据仅保存在你配置的微信云环境中。数据库权限必须设置为“仅创建者可读写”，确保分享给朋友后每个人只能看到自己的记录。</view></view></view><view class="tabs"><view class="tab" bindtap="home"><text class="tab-icon">⌂</text>首页</view><view class="tab" bindtap="records"><text class="tab-icon">≡</text>记录</view><view class="tab" bindtap="stats"><text class="tab-icon">⌁</text>统计</view><view class="tab active"><text class="tab-icon">○</text>我的</view></view>
